synopsis: "A library for directed acyclic graphs"
description: """
Directed_acyclic_graph represents well-formed directed acyclic graphs. It supports
construction with cycle detection, topological traversal, ancestor and descendant queries,
pruning, mapping, and clustering adjacent nodes.
"""
